+
+Implement JSON Merge Patch (RFC 7386): export `applyMergePatch(target, patch)` from `src/index.ts`.
+A non-object patch (including an array) replaces the target; an object patch merges member by member,
+`null` removing the member; the target and patch are never mutated or shared with the result. Invalid
+(non-JSON) inputs throw an `Error`. Cover it with tests (RFC appendix A cases) and document it in README.md.
